      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "말도 안 돼! 진짜 성공해 버리다니…!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ありえないわ！本当に成功させちゃうなんて…！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 7,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그렇다는 건…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "つまり…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 8,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "차기 대성녀는 나로 확정이란 뜻이잖아…?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "次の大聖女は、うちで決まりってこと…？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "여정을 통과했는데 다른 사람을 대성녀로 추대할 순 없을 테니까!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "旅を成し遂げたんだし、他の人になるわけないんだから！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "꺄아아악! 뮤리엘의 승리! 최고야!!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ぎゃああっ！ミュリエルの勝利！最高よ！！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "단장, 단장은 지금 어떤 기분이야? 응?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "団長、今どんな気持ち？うん？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "애석하다! 정말 성공해 버리다니!",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "悔しいよ！本当に成功させるなんて！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "뭐야, 그게! 꼭 실패하길 바란 사람처럼!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "何よそれ！失敗を望んでたみたいな言い方ね！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아하, 알겠다. 지금 걱정하고 있는 거지?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "なるほど、分かったわ。心配してるのね？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "<color=#F7BE45>헉! 앞으로 나 같은 게 뮤리엘한테 말이나 붙일 수 있을까?</color>",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "<color=#F7BE45>ハッ！この先、私なんかがミュリエルに口を利いてもいいのか？</color>",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "<color=#F7BE45>아앗, 뮤리엘 님 너무 눈부셔…! 나 같이 음침한 녀석은 바라볼 수조차 없어…!</color>",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "<color=#F7BE45>あぁ、ミュリエル様はなんて眩しいのだ…！私のような陰気な者には、見つめることすらできない…！</color>",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "……",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "……"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 18,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하긴~ 차기 대성녀는 엄~청 주목 받는 몸이고~",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そうよね～、次期大聖女は注目の的だし～？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 19,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "나 정도면 라비스타의 모든 교단들을 아우르는 그랜드 대성녀도 꿈이 아닐 테지.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "うちぐらいになれば、ラビスターのすべての教団を司る最高の大聖女だって夢じゃないわ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 20,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "너무 걱정 마. 단장이 공손히 부탁하면 내 비서로 취직시켜 주는 것도 고려해 볼게.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そんなに心配しなくてもいいわよ。団長が丁重にお願いしてくれたら、秘書として迎え入れてあげてもいいわ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 21,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아하하하핫!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あはははははっ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 22,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "어쩌면 난 세상에 큰 잘못을 저지른 걸지도…",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "もしかしたら私は、この世界にとんでもない過ちを犯してしまったのかも…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 23,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아까부터 너무하네, 정말!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "さっきからひどいわね、まったく！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 24,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
